    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "给定参考输入 r(t)，将 r 引入系统方程的最通用线性方法是在控制器方程中加入与其成比例的项：在式 (7.184b) 中加入 N̄ r，在式 (7.184a) 中加入 M r。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Given a reference input r(t), the most general linear way to introduce r into the system equations is to add terms proportional to it in the controller equations: adding N̄ r to Eq. (7.184b) and M r to Eq. (7.184a).",
